Script that intakes FEFF input files for the following versions of FEFF: FEFF6L, FEFF8.5L, FEFF9, FEFF10
and can convert the file to match the formatting of any other version. Due to licensing issues,
this script can only change the FEFF input files but cannot run the calculations for FEFF9 or FEFF10, only 
FEFF6L and FEFF8.5L because they are open-source. Users who want all their calculations to be in FEFF9 or 
FEFF10 must have licenses and run the calculations on their own.
